{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Fairloom 協助室友按房間大小、自然光、衣櫃空間、浴室使用與噪音等條件公平分攤租金，適合準備簽新租約、處理長期分租爭議，或轉租房間的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-165.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>房間評分與公平分租計算</h2>\n<p>加入每個房間後，Fairloom 可按大小、自然光、衣櫃空間、浴室使用及噪音評分，計算加權公平分攤比例，權重亦可自行調整。畫面即時顯示視覺化分攤結果與可拖放平面圖；同意數字後，可一鍵生成一頁 PDF 室友協議，列出租金明細、評分方法與簽名欄。App 完全離線運作，無需帳戶或登入，資料不會離開裝置。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-395-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-396-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-397-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-398-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-399-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-400-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Fairloom</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/fairloom/id6817602169?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:10.655039+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T14:26:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:20.989812+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:20.989812+00:00","content_hash":"64448e1ef395ccf71552167e18fe5bf8363119f255632b18246782b13d3b171a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}